{
  "_doc": "Converts recipe amounts into one base unit per ingredient so the shopping list can sum them (roadmap 2.10 p.4). 'units': grams (or ml, water density) per 1 unit, used for every ingredient. 'noQuantity': units shown as 'по вкусу' and never summed (an amount of 0 is treated the same). 'ingredients': per-ingredient overrides — 'base' is the shopping unit ('г' default, 'мл' for liquids, 'шт' for produce bought by the piece); any other key is grams per 1 unit for this ingredient ('шт' = weight of one piece). A '(150 г)' hint in recipes.json wins for г/мл-based ingredients. Every (ingredient, unit) pair must convert — migrate.js fails otherwise; check with npm run audit:ingredients.",
